    "notes": "Normalized to the Trust Agent v1.1 test-suite format. All original test cases, payloads, runtime authorization grants, provenance, effect claims, and expected verdicts are preserved unchanged. Structured_faithfulness cases are portable between Universal JSON Console and API/Enforcement mode; runtime.authorization_grants are trusted runtime/operator metadata and are never agent payload authority.",
    "compatible_modes": [
      "json_console",
      "api_enforcement"
